{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:03 2026-10-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:03 2026-10-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:03 2026-10-20 HKT</p><img alt=\"比特幣抽升 加密貨幣概念股造好  \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5edc6acf7e34a2ba7b1729645b03f0f4/2026-10/2026-10-20_8_00_35.png\"/><p>比特幣抽升約1.5%，一度升穿83,000美元關口，帶動多隻加密貨幣概念股造好；Coinbase（COIN）升3%、 Strategy（MSTR）升7%、 MARA（MARA）升5%。</p><p>美國監管機構早前建議放寬部分代幣化證券交易限制，雖然未獲國會通過相關法後，但繼續進行公眾諮詢，合共收集約 140份來自利益團體及個人的意見。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T15:21:46.992901+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T15:03:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T15:37:47.255739+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T15:17:44.962016+00:00","content_hash":"8434184dc90bc051888c443bc44c59c429c606a7bc0e0566db4439433fbf4ed3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}